silm:instances_papers_11_base_commutative_diagram_chapters_27_governance_shacl_deep_dive_sections_03_unified_constraint_theorem_concrete_anchor_0#unifiedconstraint_pi silm:hasLongDescription "The UnifiedConstraint_pi is the unified quotient pi_unified that simultaneously satisfies governance gates and SHACL shapes for the running Mittens diagram. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'UnifiedConstraint_pi', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
